---
permalink: /feed.xml
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en">
  <title>EUDI Atlas — wallet ecosystem briefing</title>
  <subtitle>The developments shaping digital wallets, why they matter, and what to check next — from the maintainers of the EUDI Trust &amp; Conformance Atlas.</subtitle>
  <id>tag:eudi-conformance-atlas,2026:feed</id>
  <link rel="self" type="application/atom+xml" href="{{ site.url | xml }}{{ '/feed.xml' | url }}"/>
  <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="{{ site.url | xml }}{{ '/' | url }}"/>
  <logo>{{ site.url | xml }}{{ '/assets/og-cover.png' | url }}</logo>
  <updated>{% if documents.changelog.length %}{{ documents.changelog[0].date | atomDate }}{% endif %}</updated>
  <author>
    <name>ForkbombEu</name>
  </author>
  <generator uri="https://www.11ty.dev/">Eleventy</generator>
{% for release in documents.changelog %}
  <entry>
    <title>{{ release.title | xml | safe }}</title>
    <id>tag:eudi-conformance-atlas,{{ release.date }}:rulebook</id>
    <updated>{{ release.date | atomDate }}</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="{{ site.url | xml }}{{ '/radar/' | url }}"/>
    <link rel="enclosure" type="image/png" href="{{ site.url | xml }}{{ '/assets/og-cover.png' | url }}"/>
    <summary>{{ release.summary | xml | safe }}</summary>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[
<p><a href="{{ site.url | xml }}{{ '/radar/' | url }}"><img src="{{ site.url | xml }}{{ '/assets/og-cover.png' | url }}" alt="EUDI Trust &amp; Conformance Atlas — the open EUDI Wallet reference" width="100%"></a></p>
<p>{{ release.summary | xml | safe }}</p>
{% for section in release.story %}
<h2>{{ section.title | xml | safe }}</h2>
<p>{{ section.text | xml | safe }}</p>
<p>Read in the Atlas: {% for id in section.documents %}{% set doc = documents.byId[id] %}<a href="{{ site.url | xml }}{{ ('/documents/' + doc.id + '/') | url }}">{{ doc.name | xml | safe }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>
{% endfor %}
<h2>Keep the context, not just the headlines</h2>
<p>Which changes affect your project? <a href="{{ site.url | xml }}{{ '/radar/' | url }}">Explore this edition in the regulatory radar</a>, or <a href="{{ site.url | xml }}{{ '/reference/' | url }}">consult the Atlas</a> to trace a document's status, related sources and assessment-version pins.</p>
<p><a href="{{ site.url | xml }}{{ '/feed.xml' | url }}">Subscribe to the EUDI Atlas RSS feed</a> — add this feed to your reader for the next briefing on what changed and why it matters.</p>
<p><strong>From the maintainers — Credimi.</strong> Turning these requirements into testable flows? <a href="https://credimi.io/login">Join Credimi</a> to automate Wallet, Issuer and Verifier conformance and interoperability runs and keep the results as shareable evidence. Testing evidence supports assurance work; it is not certification.</p>
]]></content>
  </entry>
{% endfor %}
</feed>
